<title>JAPAN: Japan end-March oil product stocks up 19.3% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan end-March oil product stocks up 19.3% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Friday issued the following data on oil product stockpiles held by refineries, distributors and importers as of end-March:</p>
<p>		 (1,000kl)   (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p> Gasoline	2,360	 14,844    + 8.8    + 5.2</p>
<p> Naphtha	 1,669	 10,498    -10.7    + 3.1</p>
<p> Jet Fuel	  681	  4,283    - 0.6    +22.7</p>
<p> Kerosene	2,412	 15,171    - 5.1    +37.4</p>
<p> Gas Oil	 2,189	 13,769    - 6.7    +34.9</p>
<p> Fuel Oil A    1,758	 11,058    + 1.3    +28.0</p>
<p> Fuel Oil B	  3	     19    -25.0    + 0.0</p>
<p> Fuel Oil C    2,282	 14,354    + 1.6    +12.7</p>
<p> Total	  13,355	 84,003    - 1.8    +19.3</p>
<p>(Figures may not tally due to rounding off.)</p>
</text>
